<title>ITALY: SOCCER-MILAN BEAT JUVENTUS IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY. [CORRECTED 21:58 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MILAN BEAT JUVENTUS IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY. [CORRECTED 21:58 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of pre-season friendly</p>
<p>between AC Milan and Juventus on Tuesday.</p>
<p>AC Milan 3 Juventus 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>AC Milan - Andre Cruz 54, Patrick Kluivert 60, George Weah 62</p>
<p>(Corrects order of goal scoring)</p>
<p>Juventus - Antonio Conte 30</p>
<p>Attendance: 76,600</p>
